# expect: `Mouse.inside` and `Window.focused` are written with `?`, and an
# unknown member of `Keyboard` or `Mouse` is reported with the closest
# name; `inside?` and `focused?` take no arguments
# at: line 7, `inside`; line 8, `focused`; line 9, `down`; line 10,
# `wheel`; line 11, `inside?`; line 12, `focused?`

puts Mouse.inside
puts Window.focused
puts Keyboard.down(Key::A)
puts Mouse.wheel
puts Mouse.inside?()
puts Window.focused?()
